Changes made in this fork
-------------------------

As required by section 4(b) of the Apache License 2.0, this list records the
changes made after the fork point. Every file that carries a Google copyright
header and that this fork changed is covered by this notice.

* The module path changed from github.com/campoy/embedmd to
  github.com/veggiemonk/embedmd.
* Process and Fetcher.Fetch take a context.Context. The HTTP fetch honours
  cancellation and deadlines.
* Errors wrap with %w, so callers can inspect them.
* The command cancels its work on SIGINT and SIGTERM.
* New directive options: line exclusion with the ! prefix, dedent, trim, and
  s/old/new/ substitution.
* The sample HTTP embed points at this fork.
* The integration test builds the binary under test from source.
* Every changed file carries a fork copyright line and a change notice, as
  Apache License 2.0 section 4(b) asks for.
* A typo in a copyright line was corrected: "Google Intt." became
  "Google Inc." in main_test.go.

Earlier changes, made before the fork point and merged upstream, are recorded
in the git history.
